We won't let her!

00:14:36.141 --> 00:14:38.844
Damn, I couldn't find anything there other
than the fact that it looked really suspicious.

00:14:38.844 --> 00:14:40.539
I need to hurry up and catch up with Yuki.

00:14:42.081 --> 00:14:43.309
Please stop!

00:14:46.752 --> 00:14:48.947
What the...

00:14:51.123 --> 00:14:52.886
Takenaga!

00:14:53.259 --> 00:14:55.750
It's me, Noi! I came to pick you up!

00:14:55.828 --> 00:14:56.852
O-Okay...

00:14:57.363 --> 00:14:58.830
So, that means...

00:15:01.600 --> 00:15:04.296
Good day to you.

00:15:04.470 --> 00:15:06.904
G-Good day indeed...

00:15:07.606 --> 00:15:09.108
Hey! Did you wait long?

00:15:09.108 --> 00:15:09.942
Ranmaru.

00:15:09.942 --> 00:15:14.580
When I explained the situation,
the only one who offered me to help was...

00:15:14.580 --> 00:15:16.649
...Tamao!

00:15:16.649 --> 00:15:19.118
Geez, don't do dangerous stuff like this!

00:15:19.118 --> 00:15:22.383
I was so worried about you! I was so worried!

00:15:23.656 --> 00:15:24.990
You idiot! You idiot! You idiot!
I-I'm sorry.

00:15:24.990 --> 00:15:26.287
You idiot! You idiot! You idiot!
More importantly, we have to find Yuki!

00:15:26.625 --> 00:15:29.025
I've heard what happened, so let us go.

00:15:29.628 --> 00:15:30.652
Thank you.

00:15:30.996 --> 00:15:34.056
No problem. This is all for my precious friends.

00:15:35.401 --> 00:15:40.072
By the way, how many weapons and
troops should we have ready?

00:15:40.072 --> 00:15:40.973
Butler...

00:15:40.973 --> 00:15:42.574
Yes, Lady Tamao.

00:15:42.574 --> 00:15:45.678
For starters, we have speciaI forces and
an infantry army of a hundred soldiers

00:15:45.678 --> 00:15:48.476
equipped with machine guns
and rocket launchers.

00:15:51.050 --> 00:15:53.814
We're confident that we have land, air
and sea completely covered.

00:15:53.986 --> 00:15:56.488
Is our satellite ready to attack yet?

00:15:56.488 --> 00:15:59.787
We're expecting it to take another
fifteen minutes to lock onto the target.

00:16:00.326 --> 00:16:03.062
I'm sorry that we're still new at this.

00:16:03.062 --> 00:16:04.496
How encouraging!

00:16:04.496 --> 00:16:06.487
Y-You didn't have to go that far.

00:16:11.937 --> 00:16:12.938
Sunako?

00:16:12.938 --> 00:16:14.707
Hey, wait!

00:16:14.707 --> 00:16:15.674
Kyohei?!

00:16:16.875 --> 00:16:18.644
Where the hell did you take her?

00:16:18.644 --> 00:16:21.747
We'II tell you if you're willing to
come back to our arcade.

00:16:21.747 --> 00:16:23.374
Just like back then.

00:16:24.049 --> 00:16:27.252
You'II get a free photo of Takano
if you buy ten tofu packages!

00:16:27.252 --> 00:16:28.947
I'II buy them!

00:16:29.154 --> 00:16:32.691
Buy a cantaloupe and a matsutake mushroom,
and we'II give you Takano's phone number!

00:16:32.691 --> 00:16:34.318
I'II buy them!

00:16:34.526 --> 00:16:37.730
Buy a snapper and a crab,
and we'II tell you Takano's address!

00:16:37.730 --> 00:16:39.698
I'II buy them!

00:16:40.432 --> 00:16:43.802
If you're around, not only people
from the neighborhood,

00:16:43.802 --> 00:16:46.572
but people from all over the country will come.

00:16:46.572 --> 00:16:48.972
Your presence will save our shopping arcade.

00:16:49.108 --> 00:16:50.609
Don't give me that crap!

00:16:50.609 --> 00:16:54.545
Whose fault do you think it is that I had
to leave? I'II never go back there!

00:16:56.148 --> 00:16:57.479
Come back.

00:16:57.916 --> 00:17:01.553
Come back... Come back...

00:17:01.553 --> 00:17:03.521
Kyohei, I'm coming to save you.

00:17:04.023 --> 00:17:07.550
Come back... Come back...

00:17:07.993 --> 00:17:11.759
Come back... Come back...

00:17:16.135 --> 00:17:18.399
Kyohei!

00:17:30.449 --> 00:17:33.852
I can't take it anymore! I hate this sound!

00:17:33.852 --> 00:17:38.152
Make it stop! Someone make it stop!

00:17:39.625 --> 00:17:42.287
Where am I supposed to go back to
when I don't have a home?

00:17:42.394 --> 00:17:42.561
sPARE

00:17:42.561 --> 00:17:44.290
sPARE
What? Kyohei?

00:17:45.864 --> 00:17:48.389
Kyohei, I'm sorry.

00:17:49.001 --> 00:17:51.731
I'm tired of this.

00:17:52.871 --> 00:17:57.103
My parents are happier without me.

00:17:58.310 --> 00:18:00.141
You've got a nice family.

00:18:00.546 --> 00:18:04.004
That's a whole lot better than being cooI.

00:18:06.118 --> 00:18:07.119
Kyohei!

00:18:07.119 --> 00:18:08.108
Wh-What the?!

00:18:10.722 --> 00:18:13.158
Kyohei is a member of our family!

00:18:13.158 --> 00:18:15.023
We won't let you have him!

00:18:15.928 --> 00:18:16.929
Yuki?

00:18:16.929 --> 00:18:18.363
Catch that little kid!

00:18:18.363 --> 00:18:19.455
Yeah!

00:18:21.400 --> 00:18:24.096
Yuki, use that axe and cut these ropes!

00:18:25.471 --> 00:18:26.768
Forget it! Just run!

00:18:28.340 --> 00:18:29.875
No one knows mochi better
than mochi makers.

00:18:29.875 --> 00:18:32.444
No one knows butchering better
than butchers, you see!

00:18:32.444 --> 00:18:34.279
Yeah, that's true... I'm really scared!

00:18:34.279 --> 00:18:35.814
Yuki, run!

00:18:35.814 --> 00:18:37.281
I'II be all right!

00:18:43.755 --> 00:18:46.155
I won't let you lay a finger on Kyohei!

00:18:51.630 --> 00:18:53.427
It was just a water drop! Calm down!

00:18:59.004 --> 00:19:00.528
B-Bring it on!

00:19:00.772 --> 00:19:02.508
S-So cute...

00:19:02.508 --> 00:19:06.145
It feels like we're bullying him.

00:19:06.145 --> 00:19:09.239
After all, we are not bad people.

00:19:09.481 --> 00:19:11.574
Here's a box cutter.
Don't cut your finger, okay?

00:19:15.787 --> 00:19:16.622
This way!

00:19:16.622 --> 00:19:19.090
Hey, don't push yourself too hard.

00:19:28.433 --> 00:19:29.568
That vehicle!

00:19:29.568 --> 00:19:31.365
It's the one they used to kidnap Kyohei.

00:19:32.905 --> 00:19:33.805
Yuki!

00:19:33.805 --> 00:19:34.669
Kyohei!

00:19:35.040 --> 00:19:36.667
Takenaga! Ranmaru!

00:19:38.010 --> 00:19:40.379
Why are Noi and that rich girI here, too?

00:19:40.379 --> 00:19:43.382
When you're in trouble, the more people
the better, you know! Right?

00:19:43.382 --> 00:19:44.178
Yes!

00:19:44.416 --> 00:19:45.584
Yuki, are you okay?

00:19:45.584 --> 00:19:46.451
Are you hurt?

00:19:46.451 --> 00:19:48.214
You scraped the top of your nose.

00:19:50.022 --> 00:19:52.257
I'm fine! I did rescue Kyohei after all!

00:19:52.257 --> 00:19:54.626
Man Courage
I'm fine! I did rescue Kyohei after all!

00:19:54.826 --> 00:19:56.851
What? No way!

00:20:00.899 --> 00:20:03.493
Th-They're here!

00:20:04.169 --> 00:20:05.938
B-B-B-Bring it on!

00:20:05.938 --> 00:20:07.306
I mean, please don't !

00:20:07.306 --> 00:20:08.739
There they are, the witchcraft users!

00:20:08.807 --> 00:20:09.808
Butler...

00:20:09.808 --> 00:20:11.275
Yes, Lady Tamao.

00:20:11.743 --> 00:20:13.370
Butler Launcher!

00:20:14.880 --> 00:20:17.007
Stop it! We understand that you've
got a nice one, so stop it!

00:20:17.216 --> 00:20:18.150
Butler...

00:20:18.150 --> 00:20:19.617
Yes, Lady Tamao.

00:20:22.888 --> 00:20:24.957
We'II let you go for today.

00:20:24.957 --> 00:20:27.492
Who do you think you are?!
You kidnapped them!

00:20:27.492 --> 00:20:30.461
We lost... We lost to your cuteness.

00:20:30.762 --> 00:20:32.457
C-Cuteness?!

00:20:32.898 --> 00:20:37.002
Takano, for his sake, we'II let you off this time.

00:20:37.002 --> 00:20:40.130
But it doesn't mean that we've given up.

00:20:41.873 --> 00:20:44.398
Whatever, just realize what you're
doing is wrong already!

00:20:47.112 --> 00:20:48.340
Oh? It's morning.

00:20:49.848 --> 00:20:51.650
Oh, my goodness! I need to
hurry up and get ready!

00:20:51.650 --> 00:20:53.285
I need to open the store!

00:20:53.285 --> 00:20:55.253
I need to start prepping the food!

00:20:57.322 --> 00:21:00.382
Anyway, what did he mean by
" lost to your cuteness"?!

00:21:00.792 --> 00:21:02.461
Did you dress up like a girI again?

00:21:02.461 --> 00:21:05.631
Seriously, your cuteness works
on everyone, Yuki.

00:21:05.631 --> 00:21:07.299
You've got invincible cuteness!

00:21:07.299 --> 00:21:09.096
That is amazing cuteness.

00:21:10.102 --> 00:21:11.729
I'm so lame...

00:21:14.373 --> 00:21:16.364
Thank you! You saved me.

00:21:26.985 --> 00:21:29.215
Well then, let's just go home!

00:21:29.721 --> 00:21:32.090
All that worrying made me hungry.

00:21:32.090 --> 00:21:33.792
Why don't we stop at a
family restaurant or something?

00:21:33.792 --> 00:21:34.960
I agree!

00:21:34.960 --> 00:21:38.263
Um, may I ask a question?

00:21:38.263 --> 00:21:39.364
What is it?

00:21:39.364 --> 00:21:41.127
Where's Miss Sunako?

00:21:41.366 --> 00:21:42.492
What?

00:21:45.671 --> 00:21:47.605
Sh-She's not here!

00:21:54.813 --> 00:21:57.582
You should ask her about Kyohei.

00:21:57.582 --> 00:21:59.117
I don't want to ask.

00:21:59.117 --> 00:22:05.078
I never want to deaI with a life controlled
by Kyohei again! Never again!

00:22:09.528 --> 00:22:11.257
A Prince in Sheep's Clothing

00:22:11.463 --> 00:22:17.891
Kimagure na atatakai te ga shinzou ni yokunai

00:22:19.037 --> 00:22:25.577
Ukkari obore chai sou dayo kimi no hitomi ni

00:22:25.577 --> 00:22:34.086
Mabushi sugite mirenai chijou no taiyou

00:22:34.086 --> 00:22:42.194
Jiri jiri watashi wo kaeteku
kore wa koi no inryoku desuka

00:22:42.194 --> 00:22:50.969
Daitan ni daive shite kami wo agete
mada mita koto nai sekai

00:22:50.969 --> 00:22:57.109
Itsuno ma ni kimi no egao konna ni shinjiteru

00:22:57.109 --> 00:23:01.780
Kikkake wa koi demo injanai, It's all right

00:23:01.780 --> 00:23:06.084
Oitsuki tai yo itsuka

00:23:06.084 --> 00:23:13.752
Kimi no hikari wo oikaze ni shite

00:23:13.892 --> 00:23:19.421
Woo, you can changing, you are only one

00:23:21.433 --> 00:23:27.133
Woo, you can changing, you can do it, now

00:23:30.942 --> 00:23:31.777
Good day!

00:23:31.777 --> 00:23:35.647
Lady Tamao, it seems that your precious
friend Miss Sunako has been kidnapped.

00:23:35.647 --> 00:23:36.248
Butler...

00:23:36.248 --> 00:23:38.683
In this case, I believe rescuing her
would be the right thing to do.

00:23:38.683 --> 00:23:39.317
Butler...

00:23:39.317 --> 00:23:40.285
Yes, Lady Tamao.

00:23:40.285 --> 00:23:41.286
Giddy-up!

00:23:41.286 --> 00:23:42.184
Yes, Lady Tamao.

